*

# Files
!Cargo.lock
!Cargo.toml
!Makefile
# The repo-root VERSION file: utils/build.rs reads it during the in-container
# cargo build to stamp AMP_VERSION. Without this re-include the `*` above drops
# it from the build context and every compute binary ships AMP_VERSION=0.0.0.
!VERSION
!postgres.mk
!rust-toolchain.toml
!scripts/ninstall.sh
!scripts/fetch-yb-thin-client.sh
!docker-compose/run-tests.sh

# Directories
!.cargo/
!.config/
# compute/ now holds pageserver, safekeeper, compute_tools,
# pgxn (the yb_amp extension), and libs — the whole storage/compute engine.
!compute/
!control_plane/
# Keep the Go controller out of the build context — unrelated controller changes
# then don't bust the Rust build stage's `COPY . .` cache. migrations/ is the
# exception: `controller/migrations/embed.go` go:embeds the .sql files, so the
# CONTROLLER image needs them to compile. The endpoint image does not use them.
!controller/
controller/*
!controller/migrations/
# The Go yb_amp_local launcher lives here; the endpoint/controller images build it.
!controller/local/
!docker-compose/ext-src
!proxy/
!storage_scrubber/
!storage_broker/
!workspace_hack/
!build-tools/patches
!deploy/endpoint/
# deploy/controller bakes the endpoint Helm chart into the controller image (the k8s
# deploy runtime installs it with `helm upgrade --install`).
!deploy/helm/
# deploy/voyager bakes AMP assess scripts into the Voyager job image.
!deploy/voyager/
# deploy/controller packages the prebuilt bundle from `make controller-bundle`.
!target/controller-bundle/
# cargo must read every workspace member's manifest to load the workspace.
!test/integration/
